Patches applied to the pristine zstd-1.5.7 tarball by ../unpack.sh.

They apply with `patch -p1` from inside src/, in filename order.  Each one
starts with a few lines of prose saying what it does and why, then the diff.

There are none: zstd builds for LikeOS as released.  What its makefiles
would decide by probing the build host is in ../config.h.

